{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Gold River Project\u2122 throws you and your friends on an epic camping survival adventure! Try to escape a grueling experiment across one of the largest private nature reserves in the Pacific Northwest. You are being watched, studied and manipulated at every turn. Solve the mysteries within and try to survive another day.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >  <strong>CAMP SOLO OR WITH FRIENDS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to Gold River! A remote camping adventure you can play alone or with up to 4 friends. A chartered float plane will drop you off by beautiful lakes where you can kayak, hike the gorgeous trails, make camp and survive the elements. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1253220/extras/85ad81c4c47d9bd4c0101851f59c6e7b.poster.avif?t=1769191984\" width=800 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1253220/extras/85ad81c4c47d9bd4c0101851f59c6e7b.webm?t=1769191984\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1253220/extras/85ad81c4c47d9bd4c0101851f59c6e7b.mp4?t=1769191984\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A TRUE CAMPING SURVIVAL EXPERIENCE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One week turns into several as you suspect your guide is never coming back. Deserted, you discover you are trapped and now an unwilling lab rat. Can you survive an ever changing, artificial environment and it's inhabitants?  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1253220/extras/3c6cf11d0dcdb9ecc590044fbf43bff2.poster.avif?t=1769191984\" width=800 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1253220/extras/3c6cf11d0dcdb9ecc590044fbf43bff2.webm?t=1769191984\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1253220/extras/3c6cf11d0dcdb9ecc590044fbf43bff2.mp4?t=1769191984\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BRAVE THE ELEMENTS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage health, hydration, hunger, fatigue, and temperature. Use your survival skills and earn badges as you learn new ones. Outlast nature and uncover the perils of what lies beneath the surface. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1253220/extras/5edaacc4ad81d9f96879c85b4856519c.poster.avif?t=1769191984\" width=800 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1253220/extras/5edaacc4ad81d9f96879c85b4856519c.webm?t=1769191984\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1253220/extras/5edaacc4ad81d9f96879c85b4856519c.mp4?t=1769191984\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>EVOLVING SEASONS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world shifts with time. Hunt in the abundance of summer, forage in the dying colors of fall, and fight for warmth in the frozen quiet of winter. Find your way through increasingly harsh environments and outsmart your captors to survive and escape.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THE WALL</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover a mysterious barrier dividing the forest. Solve environmental puzzles, sneak past security patrols, or piece together scavenged tech to bring it down your own way.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiplayer:</strong> Survive by yourself or with friends in online co-op!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Crafting:</strong> Build survival equipment, weapons, farm plots and more to help you stay alive!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Research:</strong> Learn new things to craft from items you find or from trade.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build:</strong> Expand your campsite to prepare for what's to come.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Scavenge:</strong> All items are all useful, it's up t\ufeffo you to figure it out how.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Puzzles</strong>, <strong>Stealth</strong> or <strong>Discovery:</strong>\u00a0There is more than one way out.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Progress</strong>: Play at your own pace. No time restrictions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Replayability:</strong>\u00a0Substations, supplies and points of interest\u00a0 - these locations change with each new play through.</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Swim Badge - Level 1","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1253220/78967dc72af98626cf48deee18a945c2f276222b.jpg"},{"name":"First Aid Badge - Level 1","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1253220/bfe6fe4ddc70aa3094bc5466ade8d943fe362078.jpg"},{"name":"Archery Badge - Level 1","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1253220/6c63e746617a1bda9645b368f6bd4f5691400ce5.jpg"},{"name":"Bow Hunting Badge - Level 1","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1253220/b690d954e228fbab4c61a1c9b189e1b1e35c8d78.jpg"},{"name":"Campfire Badge - Level 1","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1253220/7eda6a25ea90fd07e9a90a99f39ae5ddcb0f150c.jpg"},{"name":"Canoe Badge - Level 1","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1253220/116ea0f48e0b02d4ef2ab82d837b85d009446a1f.jpg"},{"name":"Cooking Badge - Level 1","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1253220/9d5e015a807edf703cf033d5bf67004f1e2d3bce.jpg"},{"name":"Crafting Badge - Level 1","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1253220/db9c6240c8a1905a3105056104fb603dc4d25e02.jpg"},{"name":"Exploring Badge - Level 1","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1253220/99d9e169d2d4e629f8c4ea0fdcd89c4ace735a85.jpg"},{"name":"Farming Badge - Level 1","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1253220/7e89e4122f94ed1fdb8de61ade1024c926c10ee4.jpg"}],"total":20},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1253220?t=1769191984","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1253220/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1769191984","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1253220/f7006a8eb2ff882d7983512a9f07bb937a50f289/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1769191984","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1253220/f7006a8eb2ff882d7983512a9f07bb937a50f289/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1769191984","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"There is simulated shooting and killing of other players and animals. Minimal blood and gore."},"demos":[{"appid":3758470,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h1>PERFORMANCE NOTICE</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a demanding UE5 game in Early Access development. To make sure you have the best experience, please try the free demo before purchasing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If your system runs the demo well, it will run the full game. Demo save progress carries over.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thanks for supporting <i>The Gold River Project</i>. Happy hiking!</p></p><br><h1>2026 ROAD MAP</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1253220/extras/d3adb33fea33027d78deaa34c48d097d.avif?t=1769191984\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1253220/extras_big/d3adb33fea33027d78deaa34c48d097d.avif?t=1769191984 width=1560 height=1496 /></span></p></p><br><h1>DEMO INFO</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1253220/extras/70a2d39926f24ce60bda04d1c6163e62.avif?t=1769191984\" width=745 height=240 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Demo offers a limited amount of playtime set in the Summer season, where each playthrough is unique. It\u2019s a safe and welcoming environment to get familiar with the world and its systems. We\u2019ll continue updating the demo with fixes and optimizations ahead of Early Access.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Early Access will introduce new seasons, expanded content, additional threats, unique challenges, and most importantly, unlimited playtime.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>If your system can run the Demo, you can run the Early Access version.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></p><br><h1>JOIN OUR DISCORD</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1253220/extras/6a28e3a7b9a11e3fe3106c92891dfcbb.avif?t=1769191984\" width=744 height=240 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Need more information? Want to chat with fellow campers? Come on over and join our Discord channel!</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Gold River Project\u2122 throws you and your friends on an epic camping survival adventure! Try to escape a grueling experiment across one of the largest private nature reserves in the Pacific Northwest. You are being watched, studied and manipulated at every turn. Solve the mysteries within and try to survive another day.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >  <strong>CAMP SOLO OR WITH FRIENDS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to Gold River! A remote camping adventure you can play alone or with up to 4 friends. A chartered float plane will drop you off by beautiful lakes where you can kayak, hike the gorgeous trails, make camp and survive the elements. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1253220/extras/85ad81c4c47d9bd4c0101851f59c6e7b.poster.avif?t=1769191984\" width=800 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1253220/extras/85ad81c4c47d9bd4c0101851f59c6e7b.webm?t=1769191984\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1253220/extras/85ad81c4c47d9bd4c0101851f59c6e7b.mp4?t=1769191984\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A TRUE CAMPING SURVIVAL EXPERIENCE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One week turns into several as you suspect your guide is never coming back. Deserted, you discover you are trapped and now an unwilling lab rat. Can you survive an ever changing, artificial environment and it's inhabitants?  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1253220/extras/3c6cf11d0dcdb9ecc590044fbf43bff2.poster.avif?t=1769191984\" width=800 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1253220/extras/3c6cf11d0dcdb9ecc590044fbf43bff2.webm?t=1769191984\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1253220/extras/3c6cf11d0dcdb9ecc590044fbf43bff2.mp4?t=1769191984\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BRAVE THE ELEMENTS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage health, hydration, hunger, fatigue, and temperature. Use your survival skills and earn badges as you learn new ones. Outlast nature and uncover the perils of what lies beneath the surface. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1253220/extras/5edaacc4ad81d9f96879c85b4856519c.poster.avif?t=1769191984\" width=800 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1253220/extras/5edaacc4ad81d9f96879c85b4856519c.webm?t=1769191984\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1253220/extras/5edaacc4ad81d9f96879c85b4856519c.mp4?t=1769191984\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>EVOLVING SEASONS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world shifts with time. Hunt in the abundance of summer, forage in the dying colors of fall, and fight for warmth in the frozen quiet of winter. Find your way through increasingly harsh environments and outsmart your captors to survive and escape.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THE WALL</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover a mysterious barrier dividing the forest. Solve environmental puzzles, sneak past security patrols, or piece together scavenged tech to bring it down your own way.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiplayer:</strong> Survive by yourself or with friends in online co-op!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Crafting:</strong> Build survival equipment, weapons, farm plots and more to help you stay alive!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Research:</strong> Learn new things to craft from items you find or from trade.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build:</strong> Expand your campsite to prepare for what's to come.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Scavenge:</strong> All items are all useful, it's up t\ufeffo you to figure it out how.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Puzzles</strong>, <strong>Stealth</strong> or <strong>Discovery:</strong>\u00a0There is more than one way out.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Progress</strong>: Play at your own pace. No time restrictions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Replayability:</strong>\u00a0Substations, supplies and points of interest\u00a0 - these locations change with each new play through.</p></li></ul>","developers":["Fairview Games Inc."],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1253220/e01bce2a398fd27fe8e2a68a9e85976df8fa131b/header.jpg?t=1769191984","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 2026 Fairview Games Inc. Developed by Fairview Games Inc. Published by Fairview Games Inc. and Sightline Games. All rights reserved.","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended: